{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Walking in the garden.</b> To and fro, according to the intended purpose, as in הִתְהַלֵּךְ בָּאָרֶץ (Genesis 13:17) and יִתְהַלְּכוּ מִגּוֹי אֶל גּוֹי (Psalms 105:13)." "<b>At the ruach of the day.</b> At the day's readiness to accomplish the things desired on that day, just as He did on the other days of Creation, and as He had done on that very day before their sin." "<b>And he hid himself.</b> As it says: וְלֹא יִרְאֶה בְךָ עֶרְוַת דָּבָר (Deuteronomy 23:15)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:48.385836716Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}